\fIOuter_World/games/sight.py\fR      board vision: palette naming, scene gestalt, move space
\fIOuter_World/games/memory.py\fR     what she remembers of each game
\fIOuter_World/games/directions.py\fR the rules text she is read
\fIOuter_World/games/DIRECTIONS.md\fR the rules she is read
